# BAY REFEREE needs no project API token or provider cookie.
# Connect the official Higgsfield plugin inside Codex on each machine; sign in
# manually to the workspace that contains the Engin custom voice.
#
# Setup resolves the checkout from its own file location. No absolute home path
# belongs in this file. Optional setup choices are CLI flags, not secret env vars:
#   node scripts/setup-bay-referee.mjs --python /path/to/python3.12
#   node scripts/setup-bay-referee.mjs --skill-dir /path/to/skills/bay-referee
# Existing Codex convention CODEX_HOME is honored; otherwise ~/.codex is used.
# Do not copy session cookies, tokens, raw voice references or identity photos here.
